<title>HONG KONG: Union Bank Hong Kong sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Union Bank Hong Kong sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Bayerische Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER UNION BANK OF HONG KONG	    GUARANTOR   - -</p>
<p> AMT	US$50 MLN   COUPON    3ML+45     MATURITY    5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    09.SEP.96</p>
<p> PUTS     YRS 3,4     CALLS     YRS 3,4    REPLIES     23.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	  SALE LMTS CUSTOMARY</p>
<p> NEG PLG  NO	    CRS DEF   NO	   FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW  HONG KONG   HOME CTRY HONG KONG  TAX PROV    STANDARD</p>
<p>PAY DATE 08.OCT.96 TENTATIVE</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES  CO-LEADS  US$7 MLN+  63 BP ALL-IN 66</p>
<p>			    SNR MGRS  US$5-7 MLN 60 BP ALL-IN 65</p>
<p>			    MANAGERS  US$2-5 MLN 57 BP ALL-IN 64</p>
<p>ARRANGER  BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK (BOOKS), JARDINE FLEMING BANK</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
